章類型" 開始使用。','Add Post Type'=>'添加文章類型','Log entry deleted successfully.'=>'日誌條目已成功刪除。','%d log entries deleted successfully.'=>'%d 筆日誌條目已成功刪除。','All logs have been cleared.'=>'所有日誌已被清除。','Title'=>'標題','Details'=>'詳細信息','Are you sure you want to delete this log entry?'=>'您確定要刪除這條日誌條目嗎？','View Analytics'=>'檢視分析','Tablet'=>'平板電腦','Mobile'=>'手機','Desktop'=>'桌面','%1$s from %2$s visited at %3$s'=>'%1$s 來自 %2$s 於 %3$s 訪問','%1$s visited at %2$s'=>'%1$s 於 %2$s 訪問','From %1$s, visited at %2$s'=>'來自 %1$s，訪問於 %2$s','Visited at %s'=>'訪問於 %s','via %s'=>'通過 %s','Edit shortlink settings'=>'編輯短鏈接設置','This post is in {status} status. It will become visible to the public on {date}.'=>'此貼文處於 {status} 狀態。它將於 {date} 變為對公眾可見。','Target url not found.'=>'找不到目標網址。','Invalid URL scheme. Only http, https, ftp, ftps, and mailto are allowed.'=>'無效的 URL 協議。僅允許 http、https、ftp、ftps 和 mailto。','Tiny slug could not created.'=>'無法創建微型標識。','Shortlink will appear here'=>'短連結將在此顯示','Enter a long URL and make a shortlink'=>'輸入一個長 URL 並製作短鏈接','Long URL'=>'長網址','Create Shortlink'=>'創建短鏈接','Reset Today\'s Analytics'=>'重置今天的分析','Reset Week\'s Analytics'=>'重置本週的分析','Reset Month\'s Analytics'=>'重置本月的分析','Reset Year\'s Analytics'=>'重置本年的分析','Are you sure you want to reset the analytics for this period? This action cannot be undone.'=>'您確定要重置此期間的分析嗎？此操作無法撤銷。','Today'=>'今天','Last 7 Days'=>'過去 7 天','Last 1 Month'=>'過去 1 個月','Last 1 Year'=>'過去 1 年','If you like %1$s please leave us a %2$s rating. Thank you!'=>'如果您喜歡 %1$s，請給我們留下 %2$s 評分。謝謝！','About'=>'關於','Documentation'=>'文檔','Contact'=>'聯絡','Download QR Code'=>'下載 QR 碼','We have developed extensions for the below browsers.'=>'我們已為以下瀏覽器開發擴展。','Click on your preferred one to Download the extension.'=>'點擊您偏好的選項以下載擴展。','Download the Extension'=>'下載擴展','Need PublishPress Shortlinks Support?'=>'需要 PublishPress 短連結支援嗎？','If you need help or have a new feature request, let us know.'=>'如果您需要幫助或有新的功能請求，請告訴我們。','Request Support'=>'請求支援','Detailed documentation is also availabl