lick an expired link.'=>'這是訪客點擊過期鏈接時看到的主要標題。','Expiration Notice Message'=>'過期通知消息','The message shown to visitors on the expiration notice page'=>'顯示給訪客的過期通知頁面上的消息','This is the body text explaining what happened and when visitors will be redirected.'=>'這是說明發生了什麼以及訪客何時將被重定向的正文。','Expiration Notice Link Text'=>'到期通知連結文字','The text for the button visitors click to continue'=>'訪客點擊以繼續的按鈕文字','This is the text displayed on the clickable button at the bottom of the notice page.'=>'這是在通知頁面底部可點擊按鈕上顯示的文字。','Enable Dynamic Redirects'=>'啟用動態重定向','Send visitors to different destinations when they match an enabled rule.'=>'當訪客符合啟用規則時，將其發送到不同的目的地。','Fallback Destination'=>'後備目的地','The Target URL in the General tab is used whenever no enabled rule matches.'=>'當沒有啟用的規則匹配時，常規標籤中的目標 URL 將被使用。','Redirect Rules'=>'重定向規則','Rules are checked from top to bottom. The first matching rule is used.'=>'規則從上到下檢查。使用第一個匹配的規則。','Add Rule'=>'新增規則','A shortlink can contain up to 100 redirect rules.'=>'短連結最多可以包含 100 條重定向規則。','Redirect Rule'=>'重定向規則','Rule Status'=>'規則狀態','Rule Name'=>'規則名稱','Example: Redirect Rule 1'=>'範例：重定向規則 1','Destination URL'=>'目的地 URL','Use an HTTP or HTTPS URL. Empty, invalid, and self-referencing rules are saved as disabled.'=>'使用 HTTP 或 HTTPS URL。空的、無效的和自我引用的規則將被保存為禁用。','Countries'=>'國家','Any country'=>'任何國家','Only selected countries'=>'僅限所選國家','All except selected countries'=>'所有國家（不包括所選國家）','Selected Countries'=>'選擇國家','United Kingdom'=>'英國','Nigeria'=>'尼日利亞','United States'=>'美國','Select countries'=>'選擇國家','Devices'=>'設備','Leave every option unchecked to match any device.'=>'將所有選項保持未勾選以匹配任何設備。','Referrer'=>'引薦來源','Any referrer'=>'任何引薦來源','Direct or unknown only'=>'僅限直接或未知','Only selected domains'=>'僅限選定的網域','All except selected domains'=>'所有除了選定的網域','Referrer Domains'=>'引薦網域','Enter domains separated by commas or new lines. Subdomains also match their parent domain.'=>'輸入以逗號或換行分隔的網域。子網域也匹配其父網域。','Post type (row %d)'=>'Post type (第 %d 行)','When to list shortlinks (row %d)'=>'何時列出短連結 (第 %d 行)','Move row %d up'=>'將第 %d 行向上移動','Move row %d down'=>'將第 %d 行向下移動','Remove row %d'=>'刪除第 %d 行','Row moved to position %1$d of %2$d.'=>'行已移動到第 %1$d 的 %2$d。','Row removed.'=>'行已刪除。','Copy shortlink %s'=>'複製短連結 %s','— No Change —'=>'— 無變更 —','Short String'=>'短字串','Quick Edit'=>'快速編輯','Use an http, https, ftp, ftps, or mailto URL.'=>'使用 http、https、ftp、ftps 或 mailto URL。','Duplicate'=>'複製','You are not allowed to duplicate this shortlink.'=>'您不被允許複製此短連結。','Shortlink duplication failed'=>'短連結複製失敗','Shortlink duplication denied.'=>'短連結複製被拒絕。','The original shortlink could not be found.'=>'找不到原始短鏈接。','Duplicate of %s'=>'%s 的複製','The draft exists but metadata permissions prevented duplication.'=>'草稿存在，但元數據權限阻止了複製。','The draft exists but duplication was not fully confirmed.'=>'草稿存在，但複製未完全確認。','Shortlink duplicated as a draft. Review it, then publish when ready.'=>'短連結已作為草稿複製。請檢閱後再發布。','Remove from favorites'=>'從收藏夾中移除','Add to favorites'=>'加入收藏夾','Favorites'=>'收藏夾','You are not allowed to favorite this shortlink.'=>'您不被允許將此短鏈接加入收藏夾。','Favorite could not be updated'=>'收藏夾無法更新','Analytics could not be read.'=>'無法讀取分析數據。','Search shortlinks'=>'搜尋短鏈接','Loading'=>'載入中','Shortlink search results'=>'短連結搜尋結果','1 shortlink found. Use the up and down arrow keys to choose.'=>'找到 1 個短連結。使用上下箭頭鍵選擇。','%d shortlinks found. Use the up and down arrow keys to choose.'=>'%d 個短連結被找到。使用上下箭頭鍵選擇。','Invalid custom date range.'=>'無效的自訂日期範圍。','Invalid uploaded file.'=>'無效的上傳檔案。','Please upload a valid CSV file.'=>'請上傳有效的 CSV 檔案。','Import and export'=>'匯入與匯出','Import progress'=>'匯入進度','PublishPress Shortlinks slug.'=>'PublishPress 短鏈接別名。','Copy'=>'複製','Copy failed'=>'複製失敗','Enter a shortlink slug to create a shortlink URL.'=>'輸入短鏈接標識以創建短鏈接 URL。','Shortlink Slug'=>'短鏈接標識','Shortlink URL'=>'短鏈接 URL','Dynamic Redirects'=>'動態重定向','Scheduling'=>'排程','Pretty Links'=>'漂亮的鏈接','Import branded and affiliate links from Pretty Links.'=>'從漂亮的鏈接導入品牌和聯盟鏈接。','BetterLinks'=>'更好的鏈接','Import link redirects, slugs, and link settings from BetterLinks.'=>'從更好的鏈接導入鏈接重定向、標識和鏈接設置。','ThirstyAffiliates'=>'ThirstyAffiliates','Import affiliate links and redirect settings from ThirstyAffiliates.'=>'從ThirstyAffiliates導入聯盟鏈接和重定向設置。','URL Shortify'=>'URL 短縮','Import short links managed by URL Shortify.'=>'導入由URL短縮管理的短鏈接。','LinkCentral'=>'LinkCentral','Import managed short links from LinkCentral.'=>'從LinkCentral導入管理的短鏈接。','ShortLinks Pro'=>'ShortLinks Pro','Import short links, redirects, and link options from ShortLinks Pro.'=>'從 ShortLinks Pro 導入短連結、重定向和連結選項。','Easy Affiliate Links'=>'Easy Affiliate Links','Import affiliate link redirects from Easy Affiliate Links.'=>'從 Easy Affiliate Links 導入聯盟連結重定向。','Simple URLs'=>'Simple URLs','Import clean URL redirects from Simple URLs.'=>'從 Simple URLs 導入乾淨的 URL 重定向。','Affiliate Links'=>'Affiliate Links','Import cloaked affiliate links from Affiliate Links.'=>'從 Affiliate Links 導入隱藏的聯盟連結。','Migration'=>'移轉','Migration is running...'=>'移轉正在進行中...','Migration complete.'=>'移轉完成。','Migration failed.'=>'移轉失敗。','Deactivate %s'=>'停用 %s','PublishPress Shortlinks:'=>'PublishPress 短連結：','We detected %s. You can review migration options for existing links.'=>'我們檢測到 %s。您可以檢查現有連結的移轉選項。','Review Migration Options'=>'檢查移轉選項','Remind me later'=>'稍後提醒我','Dismiss'=>'忽略','You do not have permission to access this page.'=>'您沒有權限訪問此頁面。','Already using another link management tool? Review detected plugins and prepare your existing links for import into PublishPress Shortlinks.'=>'已經在使用其他連結管理工具？檢查檢測到的外掛並準備您現有的連結以導入到 PublishPress 短連結。','%d supported migration source(s) detected.'=>'檢測到 %d 個支援的移轉來源。','No supported active link management plugins were detected on this site.'=>'在此網站上未檢測到任何支援的活動鏈接管理插件。','Already have a CSV export from %s? Use Import Tools to upload and preview it before importing.'=>'已經從 %s 獲得 CSV 匯出？使用匯入工具上傳並預覽後再匯入。','Migrate'=>'遷移','Direct migration unavailable'=>'直接遷移不可用','Open Import Tools'=>'打開匯入工具','Migration source is not active.'=>'遷移來源未啟用。','Direct migration is not available for this plugin yet. Please use Import Tools with a CSV export.'=>'此插件尚未提供直接遷移功能。請使用帶有 CSV 匯出的匯入工具。','Missing target URL.'=>'缺少目標 URL。','Missing shortlink slug.'=>'缺少短鏈接標識。','Could not create shortlink.'=>'無法創建短鏈接。','Default Target'=>'預設目標','Redirecting automatically in %s seconds.'=>'自動重定向在 %s 秒後進行。','Stop redirect'=>'停止重定向','Automatic redirect stopped.'=>'自動重定向已停止。','Settings sections'=>'設定區域','Search settings'=>'搜尋設定','Search post types'=>'搜索文章類型','Filter post types...'=>'篩選文章類型...','No post types match your search.'=>'沒有文章類型符合您的搜索。','No data available.'=>'沒有可用的數據。','Select which post types will have shortlinks available.'=>'選擇哪些文章類型將可以使用短鏈接。','Shortlinks metabox and column will only appear on selected post types.'=>'短鏈接元框和列將僅顯示在選定的文章類型上。','Select all logs'=>'選擇所有日誌','Select log entry %d'=>'選擇日誌條目 %d','Dynamic Redirect'=>'動態重定向','Redirected by %s'=>'由 %s 重定向','Copy shortlink'=>'複製短連結','Shortlink slug'=>'短連結標識','Enter a shortlink slug.'=>'輸入短連結標識。','The Shortlink exists but metadata authorization prevented setup.'=>'短連結存在，但元數據授權阻止了設置。','Find Shortlink categories'=>'尋找短連結類別','List native link categories with their current revision.'=>'列出原生連結類別及其當前修訂版本。','Create or update a Shortlink category'=>'創建或更新短連結類別','Use native taxonomy controls and permissions. Read expected_hash from list-categories before editing; omitted fields are preserved.'=>'使用原生分類控制和權限。在編輯之前從 list-categories 讀取 expected_hash；省略的欄位將被保留。','Set Shortlink categories'=>'設置短連結類別','Replace native category assignments with an explicit integer list. [] clears assignments; use the current get-link revision.'=>'用明確的整數列表替換原生類別分配。[] 將清除分配；使用當前的 get-link 修訂版本。','Set my Shortlink favorite'=>'設定我的短網址最愛','Set favorite true or false for the connected user only. Read the current get-link revision first.'=>'僅對連接的用戶設置最愛為真或假。請先閱讀當前的 get-link 修訂。','Update multiple Shortlinks'=>'更新多個短網址','Preflight up to 20 existing links before any writes. Linked source targets must not overlap. Each item uses the original get-link revision. Native writes are not transactional: inspect complete, applied_ids and failed_id. dry_run previews all items.'=>'在任何寫入之前檢查多達 20 個現有鏈接。鏈接的來源目標必須不重疊。每個項目都使用原始的 get-link 修訂。原生寫入不是事務性的：檢查 complete、applied_ids 和 failed_id。dry_run 預覽所有項目。','Delete a Shortlink category'=>'刪除短網址類別','Delete a native category without deleting its links. Authorize every affected link and child category; read the current category revision first.'=>'刪除一個原生類別，而不刪除其鏈接。授權每個受影響的鏈接和子類別；請先閱讀當前類別修訂。','Read Shortlink click counts'=>'閱讀短網址點擊計數','Read native daily chart counts and reset revision for one readable link. Visitor IPs, user identifiers, referrers and raw request logs are excluded.'=>'閱讀原生每日圖表計數並重置可讀鏈接的一個修訂。排除訪客 IP、用戶標識符、引薦和原始請求日誌。','Reset Shortlink chart counts'=>'重置短網址圖表計數','Mark this link analytics cleared through the native reset service. Audit logs remain. Requires current analytics expected_hash, analytics and object edit permissions. dry_run previews.'=>'標記此鏈接的分析已通過原生重置服務清除。審計日誌仍然存在。需要當前的分析 expected_hash、分析和對象編輯權限。dry_run 預覽。','Read saved Shortlink health'=>'閱讀已保存的短網址健康狀況','Read the native Pro health status and response code for one readable link. Does not perform HTTP requests.'=>'閱讀可讀鏈接的一個原生 Pro 健康狀態和響應代碼。無法執行 HTTP 請求。','Check Shortlink health'=>'檢查短網址健康狀況','Run the active native Pro link checker for an editable link and store its result. Native URL safety and type settings apply. Requires current get-link expected_hash. dry_run does not request destinations.'=>'運行可編輯鏈接的活動原生 Pro 鏈接檢查器並存儲其結果。適用原生 URL 安全性和類型設置。需要當前的 get-link expected_hash。dry_run 不請求目的地。','Read a post Shortlink'=>'閱讀一個帖子短網址','Read the native editor Short String for an enabled post type without generating a URL or changing metadata.'=>'閱讀一個啟用的帖子類型的原生編輯器短字符串，而不生成 URL 或更改元數據。','Set a post Short String'=>'設置一個帖子短字符串','Update an enabled post native Short String, preserving other metabox values. All auto-listed mirror links need permission and are included in the revision. dry_run previews.'=>'更新一個啟用的帖子原生短字符串，保留其他元框值。所有自動列出的鏡像鏈接需要權限並包含在修訂中。dry_run 預覽。','Set Shortlink publication status'=>'設置短網址發布狀態','Change a native link to publish, draft, pending or private with the current revision and native publication permissions. Source-linked records retain their native source lifecycle.'=>'更改一個原生鏈接為發布、草稿、待處理或私有，並使用當前修訂和原生發布權限。源鏈接的記錄保持其原生源生命週期。','Duplicate a Shortlink to a draft'=>'將短網址複製到草稿','Use the native Duplicate service with a new Short String and the connected user as author. Requires source edit/read, category assignment and create permissions. No password values are returned. dry_run previews without creating a draft.'=>'使用原生複製服務，並以新的短字符串和連接用戶作為作者。需要源編輯/閱讀、類別分配和創建權限。不返回密碼值。dry_run 在不創建草稿的情況下預覽。','Clear the native autolink cache'=>'清除原生自動鏈接緩存','Invalidate native Pro autolink rules without changing links or settings. Requires native manage_options and Shortlinks settings permission. dry_run previews.'=>'使原生 Pro 自動鏈接規則失效，而不更改鏈接或設置。需要原生 manage_options 和 Shortlinks 設置權限。dry_run 預覽。','Read a Shortlinks report summary'=>'閱讀短網址報告摘要','Read native Pro totals, distinct visitor counts and averages for up to 20 explicit readable links between start_date and end_date (YYYY-MM-DD). No IPs, account IDs, referrers or request URLs are returned. Native report totals include retained logs after chart resets.'=>'閱讀原生 Pro 總數、獨立訪客計數和在 start_date 和 end_date (YYYY-MM-DD) 之間的平均值，最多 20 個明確的可讀鏈接。不返回 IP、帳戶 ID、引薦或請求 URL。原生報告總數包括圖表重置後保留的日誌。','Read Shortlinks settings'=>'閱讀短網址設置','Discover exact native settings, choices and defaults. Passwords, license data and unsupported native controls are excluded. Booleans are JSON booleans, IDs integers, selections strings and lists arrays.'=>'發現準確的原生設置、選擇和默認值。密碼、許可證數據和不受支持的原生控件被排除。布林值為 JSON 布林值，ID 為整數，選擇為字符串，列表為數組。','Update Shortlinks settings'=>'更新短網址設置','Patch discovered fields using their exact schemas and current expected_hash. Omitted settings and secrets remain unchanged. dry_run previews native sanitized values.'=>'使用其確切架構和當前 expected_hash 修補發現的字段。省略的設置和密碼保持不變。dry_run 預覽原生清理過的值。','Find Shortlinks'=>'查找短網址','List readable Shortlinks by title or status. Returns IDs and labels only; use get-link to inspect configuration.'=>'按標題或狀態列出可讀的短網址。僅返回 ID 和標籤；使用 get-link 來檢查配置。','Read a Shortlink'=>'閱讀一個短網址','Read native per-link fields and current expected_hash; omit id to discover defaults. No link passwords, raw visitor IPs or user-agent logs are returned.'=>'閱讀原生每個鏈接字段和當前 expected_hash；省略 id 以發現默認值。不返回鏈接密碼、原始訪客 IP 或用戶代理日誌。','Create or update a Shortlink'=>'創建或更新短網址','Create a published Shortlink with target_url and label, or patch id with current expected_hash. Native redirect, expiration, autolink and active Pro controls use discovered fields. All related source posts must be editable. dry_run previews. No destination URLs are fetched.'=>'創建一個已發布的短網址，並具有 target_url 和標籤，或用當前 expected_hash 修補 id。原生重定向、過期、自動鏈接和活動 Pro 控件使用發現的字段。所有相關的源帖子必須是可編輯的。dry_run 預覽。不獲取目的地 URL。','Trash, restore or delete a Shortlink'=>'垃圾箱、恢復或刪除短網址','Native Shortlink lifecycle; permanent deletion requires prior trash. Requires current expected_hash and native deletion permission. dry_run previews.'=>'原生短網址生命週期；永久刪除需要先前的垃圾桶。需要當前 expected_hash 和原生刪除權限。dry_run 預覽。','Narrow the search or use native administration for more than 1,000 links.'=>'縮小搜索範圍或使用原生管理來處理超過 1,000 條鏈接。','Revision destinations and routing follow the native revision workflow.'=>'修訂目的地和路由遵循原生修訂工作流程。','Supply target_url for a new Shortlink.'=>'提供 target_url 以建立新的短鏈接。','Use a nonempty short path with letters, numbers, dashes or underscores.'=>'使用一個非空的短路徑，包含字母、數字、破折號或底線。','The short path is unavailable.'=>'短路徑不可用。','This label choice is not available for the destination.'=>'此標籤選擇在目標中不可用。','The post exists but metadata permissions changed. Read before retrying.'=>'文章存在但元數據權限已更改。請在重試前先閱讀。','Manage linked source records in native administration.'=>'在本地管理中管理鏈接的源記錄。','Read the current lifecycle state first.'=>'請先閱讀當前的生命週期狀態。','Unknown Shortlink category.'=>'未知的短鏈接類別。','Supply a category name.'=>'提供一個類別名稱。','Use an existing parent without a cycle.'=>'使用一個現有的父項，且不形成循環。','Bulk short paths must be unique.'=>'批量短路徑必須是唯一的。','Bulk targets and linked source records must not overlap.'=>'批量目標和鏈接的源記錄不得重疊。','Use native administration for this category scope.'=>'對於此類別範圍，請使用本地管理。','Use native analytics for more than 1,000 daily records.'=>'對於超過 1,000 條每日記錄，請使用本地分析。','Use native analytics for this destination scope.'=>'對於此目標範圍，請使用本地分析。','Analytics changed; read it again before resetting.'=>'分析已更改；在重置之前請再次閱讀。','This link type is disabled in native Link Health settings.'=>'在本地鏈接健康設置中，此鏈接類型已被禁用。','Native source mirrors could not be safely read.'=>'本地源鏡像無法安全地讀取。','The source or a mirror changed; read it again.'=>'源或鏡像已更改；請再次閱讀。','Use a nonempty short path.'=>'使用一個非空的短路徑。','This short path is unavailable.'=>'此短路徑不可用。','Duplicate revision-linked records through the native revision workflow.'=>'通過本地修訂工作流程複製修訂鏈接的記錄。','Use valid native report dates in YYYY-MM-DD format.'=>'使用有效的本地報告日期，格式為 YYYY-MM-DD。','The report end date must not precede its start.'=>'報告結束日期不得早於開始日期。','Native report data could not be read.'=>'無法讀取本地報告數據。','PublishPress plugin actions.'=>'PublishPress 插件操作。','Supply each native list identifier only once.'=>'每個本地列表標識符僅需提供一次。','Use the native date or time format returned by discovery.'=>'使用發現返回的本地日期或時間格式。','A native field validator rejected this value.'=>'本地字段驗證器拒絕了此值。','Use the exact fields, types and choices returned by discovery.'=>'使用發現返回的確切字段、類型和選擇。','You do not have permission to use this Shortlinks operation.'=>'您沒有權限使用此短鏈接操作。','Invalid JSON type at %s.'=>'在 %s 處的 JSON 類型無效。','Shortlinks could not complete this operation. Inspect the current state before retrying; some changes may have been saved.'=>'短鏈接無法完成此操作。在重試之前檢查當前狀態；某些更改可能已被保存。','This object changed. Read it again before saving.'=>'此對象已更改。在保存之前請再次閱讀。','The operation could not be fully confirmed. Read the object before retrying; some changes may have been saved.'=>'操作無法完全確認。在重試之前請閱讀對象；某些更改可能已被保存。','(has errors)'=>'（有錯誤）','Help'=>'幫助','Settings not saved. Please fix the highlighted errors.'=>'設定未保存。請修正突出顯示的錯誤。','Create a Shortlink'=>'創建短鏈接','Reset Yesterday\'s Analytics'=>'重置昨天的分析','Reset Last 30 Days Analytics'=>'重置過去30天的分析','Reset Last Month\'s Analytics'=>'重置上個月的分析','Reset Last 2 Years Analytics'=>'重置過去2年的分析','Reset Custom Range Analytics'=>'重置自定義範圍的分析','Reset All Time Analytics'=>'重置所有時間的分析','Showing data from %1$s to %2$s'=>'顯示從 %1$s 到 %2$s 的數據','Analytics updated. Total clicks: %1$s. Unique visitors: %2$s. Days with clicks: %3$s. Average per click day: %4$s.'=>'分析已更新。總點擊次數：%1$s。獨立訪客：%2$s。點擊天數：%3$s。每日平均點擊：%4$s。','No click data available for this period.'=>'此期間沒有可用的點擊數據。','click'=>'點擊','clicks'=>'點擊次數','Clicks over time'=>'隨時間變化的點擊數','Yesterday'=>'昨天','Last 30 Days'=>'過去30天','This Month'=>'本月','Last Month'=>'上個月','This Year'=>'今年','Last 2 Years'=>'過去2年','Custom Range'=>'自定範圍','All Time'=>'所有時間','From:'=>'從：','To:'=>'到：','Days With Clicks'=>'有點擊的天數','Avg. per Click Day'=>'平均每點擊天數','Clicks Over Time'=>'隨時間的點擊數','five-star'=>'五顆星','PublishPress (opens in a new tab)'=>'PublishPress（在新標籤頁中開啟）','QR code for this shortlink'=>'該短鏈接的 QR 碼','PublishPress Shortlinks Free requires PHP 8.2 or newer. The plugin cannot run until PHP is updated.'=>'PublishPress Shortlinks Free 需要 PHP 8.2 或更新版本。該外掛在 PHP 更新前無法運行。','PublishPress Shortlinks Free requires WordPress 6.7 or newer. The plugin cannot run until WordPress is updated.'=>'PublishPress Shortlinks Free 需要 WordPress 6.7 或更新版本。該外掛在 WordPress 更新前無法運行。','Shortlink created:'=>'已創建短鏈接：','The shortlink could not be created. Please try again.'=>'短鏈接無法創建。請再試一次。','No matching settings'=>'沒有匹配的設置','Try a different keyword or clear the search to see all settings.'=>'嘗試其他關鍵字或清除搜尋以查看所有設置。','1 matching setting'=>'1 個匹配的設置','%d matching settings'=>'%d 個匹配的設置']];